<script lang="ts">import {onMount} from 'svelte';import {enhance} from '$app/forms';import {money} from '$lib/finance';let {data,form}=$props();let ready=$state(false);onMount(()=>ready=true);</script>
<h1>Your invoices</h1><p class="muted">Balances and receipts reflect activity reconciled by your contractor. Contact us if a recent payment is not shown.</p>
{#each data.invoices as invoice}<section class="row"><h2>{invoice.number}</h2><p>Issued {invoice.date} · Due {invoice.dueDate}</p><p>Total {money(invoice.total)} · <strong>{invoice.balance===0?'Paid':`Balance ${money(invoice.balance)}`}</strong></p>{#if invoice.balance>0&&invoice.paymentUrl}<a href={invoice.paymentUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">Pay securely with Stripe</a>{/if}<details><summary>Payment and adjustment history</summary>{#if invoice.historyFrom}<p class="muted">Recorded activity since {invoice.historyFrom}. Earlier payments are reflected in the opening balance; contact your contractor for earlier history.</p>{/if}{#each invoice.receipts as receipt}<p>{receipt.date} · {receipt.kind} · {money(receipt.amount)} · {receipt.reference}</p>{:else}<p>No receipts recorded yet.</p>{/each}</details></section>{:else}<p>No invoices have been shared with your account.</p>{/each}

<h2>Progress billing applications</h2><p>Review the work billed this period and the retained amount. Your acknowledgment is recorded separately from your contractor’s accounting approval.</p>{#if form?.message}<p role="status">{form.message}</p>{/if}{#each data.construction.applications as application}<section class="row"><h3>{application.number} · {application.status}</h3><p>{application.periodStart} – {application.periodEnd}</p><p>Prior billed {money(application.priorBilled)} · Current billing {money(application.currentBilling)} · Retainage {money(application.retainage)} · Net due {money(application.totalDue)}</p><details><summary>Application work details</summary>{#each application.lines as line}<p>{line.description} · New completed work {money(line.currentBilling)} · Newly stored materials {money(line.newStoredMaterials??0)} · Installed from previously billed stored {money(line.installedFromStored??0)}</p>{/each}</details>{#if application.customerApproved}<p>Acknowledgment recorded.</p>{:else if ['IN_REVIEW','APPROVED'].includes(application.status)}<form method="POST" action="?/approve" use:enhance><input type="hidden" name="version" value={data.construction.version}/><input type="hidden" name="applicationId" value={application.id}/><label>Your name<input name="name" required/></label><label><span><input name="confirm" type="checkbox" required/>I reviewed this application and acknowledge the billed progress.</span></label><button disabled={!ready}>Record application acknowledgment</button></form>{/if}</section>{:else}<p>No progress billing applications have been shared.</p>{/each}
